# Food Court: Dead Mall, track 2 (SPEC 19.7). Round the atrium on the
# mezzanine: along the north balcony, where the ceiling tiles of the level
# below are all that hold the floor up (a crust band: the car behind
# falls through), down the east side weaving between the food-court
# tables, under the giant dead pretzel sign, jumping the stalled
# escalators on the south side, past a breaker the racks overloaded (a
# sparking panel), and up the west balcony with nothing between the road
# and the atrium (an open edge: leave the road and you drop a floor).
name FOOD COURT
order 2
floor food
background food
league dead_mall
width 50
pit_band 11                        # the atrium is open from balcony to balcony
# x    y    half   features
 260  150   54                     # start line, heading east
 470  135   54     crates          # the north balcony
 640  170   50     crust           # ceiling tiles hold the floor here
 780  135   50
 890  220   48
 880  380   46                     # weaving between the tables
 780  470   44
 800  600   44
 900  700   46
 860  860   50
 700  895   52     ramp            # the stalled escalators: jump them
 460  895   52
 300  880   50     crates
 180  780   48     vent:left,phase=60   # the overloaded breaker
 150  600   50     open:right      # the west balcony, the atrium on the right
 160  400   50     open:right
 190  250   52     bay:left
props palm,kiosk seg 1 side left gap 70 off 22
props kiosk,vending seg 5 side both gap 70 off 24
props palm,neon seg 9 side left gap 80 off 22
props vending,palm seg 12 side left gap 70 off 22
props neon seg 3 side left gap 60 off 22
